patch type="fixed" "Single peer connection offers no longer rewrite `a=inactive` to `a=recvonly`. The rewrite was ported from rust-sdks, where it compensated for passing libwebrtc's legacy `offerToReceive` option as 0; this SDK never passes that option, so receive-only transceivers already offer `recvonly`. Its only effect here was to advertise `recvonly` for sections whose transceiver `removeTrack` had stopped, inviting media that section could never receive"
